OL,4,CDozens missing after boat carrying 100 
OL,5,Cmigrants sinks off Senegal's coast     
OL,6,GSenegalese authorities are continuing  
OL,7,Gsearch operations after a boat         
OL,8,Greportedly carrying about 100 migrants 
OL,9,Gcapsized off the coast.                
OL,11,FInitial reports said that one person   
OL,12,Fhad died, but some local media have    
OL,13,Freported that at least four bodies     
OL,14,Fhave been recovered. Dozens of people  
OL,15,Fare still missing.                     
OL,17,FPersonal belongings were found on the  
OL,18,Fbadly damaged boat, which washed       
OL,19,Fashore near the village of Yenne,      
OL,20,Fsouth of Dakar. Search operations      
OL,21,Fcontinued throughout Wednesday and     
OL,22,Fwere due to resume on Thursday.        
